  step,dige:b155a089dc38d90f
  step=2,dige:3d6a1a2c3d4e737c,desc:seed twenty cogs across three genera — eight oak seven pine five birch
  step=3,dige:6857b6aef3d601f9,desc:commission the glass folded on the twenty cogs — the crowd crushes to its crests
    Assertion:board-folded,sentence:the glass was commissioned folded on twenty cogs and stood its board
    Assertion:crushed,sentence:a crowded scope self-distils — twenty cogs crush to three crest cells one per genus and every source cog is folded away behind them
    Assertion:crest-counts,sentence:each crest carries its true subsumed count — the oak crest speaks for eight the pine for seven and the birch for five
  step=4,dige:2761b2c31a988c0a,desc:re-commission the same cogs plain — no fold so twenty cells stand and no crest is minted
    Assertion:crush-load-bearing,sentence:the crush is load-bearing — commissioned plain the same twenty cogs draw twenty cells and no crest is minted
